        <p>The Mirror Tells. Fair Faces Marred by Marks of Silent Suffering. Health's Roses and the full Joy of Life are restored by Dr.Williams' Pink Pills</p>
        <p>A woman's features quickly announce by lines of suffering any disturbance of health. Dull sunken eyes surrounded by dark rings, blanched cheeks and lips, and a sallow complexion tell of Aneemia's ravages; while Low Spirits, Indigestion. &amp; Backaches complete her Miseries. To the suffering sex at all ages, Dr. Williams' Pink Pills give a helping hand and the Joy of full health by increasing. enriching, and purifying the Blood. They impart bright eyes, rosy cheeks, brilliant complexions, keen</p>
