        <head>VOLUNTEER PRIZE ISEr.TING. Results of Whitsua Competitions.</head>
        <p>VOLUNTEER PRIZE ISEr.TING. Results of Whitsua Competitions.</p>
        <p>Saturday saw the opening of the shooting competi- tions open to Warrington Volunteers' which are being conducted at the Appleton Rifle Range. Valuable prizes are offered and in each section numerous entries were to be recorded. The firing was continued on Mon- day and considering the state of the weather and the very bad light the appended results show first class markmanship. SERGEANTS' COMPETITION.</p>
        <p>Seven rounds, 3-inch bull. Seven rounds, vanishing figure target. Any military position. Any competitor who has put in less than five drills by May 18th will have one point deducted for each drill that he is short ef five.</p>
