      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1907-05-25_WidnesExaminer_art0142" n="art0142">
        <head>LETTERS TO THE EDITOR</head>
        <p>LETTERS TO THE EDITOR</p>
        <p>NOTICE TO CORRESPONDENTS. Authors of letters intended for publication must in • all cases send their names and addresses to the Editor an a guarantee of good faith.</p>
